  "appearance": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "It looks like a giant water bug the size of a basin. It has a triangular head and short feelers, and under the feelers are two compound eyes shining in golden light. Its body is flat and oval, dark-red, with a sandy feel, and it is warm. It has three pairs of legs; the front pair is the strongest and looks like two thick pincers.",
